    "The folded letter is still in your hand."

    g "Dinner's ready!"

    p "Coming!"

    "You carefully put the letter back into its folds."

    "This time, you don't hide it behind the photograph."

    "You place it gently on the desk."

    "Beside the picture frame."

    "Then you get up."

